            <ArticleTitle>A rare case of acute intestinal obstruction due to bowel entrapment in migrated onlay polypropylene mesh.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>e4-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1308/003588414X13946184900200</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Onlay mesh hernioplasty is the gold standard technique in the management of inguinal hernias. We report a rare case of intraperitoneal mesh migration with bowel entrapment causing acute intestinal obstruction in an elderly patient.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
